Data, models and services used at run time (never bundled; downloaded or accessed by the user)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* Copernicus Sentinel-1/-2 data: free, full and open under the Copernicus Sentinel data terms. Rasters derived
  from them carry "Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data <year>" (GeoTIFF tag GEOCROP_ATTRIBUTION, COG
  exports and STAC items).
* Model checkpoints and weights (Fields of The World, Presto, Galileo, AnySat, OmniCloudMask) and public
  datasets (EuroCrops, WorldCereal crop calendars, AlphaEarth, TESSERA) keep their own licences; see
  docs/licences-and-weights.md. ShareAlike (CC-BY-SA) data and labels derived from them must be shared under the
  same terms; non-commercial FTW checkpoints are refused unless explicitly allowed.
* Optional web-map basemaps: OpenStreetMap tiles (data ODbL, "© OpenStreetMap contributors"; OSMF tile usage
  policy) and EOX Sentinel-2 cloudless (CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, NON-COMMERCIAL use only: commercial deployments must
  disable it or obtain a licence from EOX IT Services GmbH). Both are off by default.
* ESA SNAP and the third-party Python libraries installed as dependencies retain their own licences; none is
  redistributed in this repository. A binary bundle such as a Docker image additionally contains those
  libraries (e.g. GEOS, LGPL-2.1, inside the shapely wheel) and must carry their notices.
